  "name": {
   "zh": "重新打光 · DiffusionRenderer 估光",
   "en": "Relight · DiffusionRenderer Auto Light"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Cosmos DiffusionRenderer 不做显式光线传输模拟，从 G-buffer 生成照片级画面。这张卡不用自备 HDRI：取一帧，LuxDiT 估出 HDR 环境贴图，再交给 DiffusionRenderer 重新打光；交付 EXR 的 rgba。DiffusionRenderer 可商用、LuxDiT 仅限研究，整卡按仅限研究；商用请用「重新打光 · DiffusionRenderer」。",
   "en": "Cosmos DiffusionRenderer produces photorealistic images from G-buffers without explicit light transport simulation. This card needs no HDRI of your own: LuxDiT estimates an HDR environment map from one frame, then DiffusionRenderer relights with it; it delivers the EXR's rgba. DiffusionRenderer allows commercial use but LuxDiT is research only, so the whole card is research only; for commercial use, use Relight · DiffusionRenderer."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-21T17:00:00",
  "deliverable": "relight",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
